{"id":"f115352299e944bf","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-pr-graph-interface.md","title":"Uniform Indexed Graph-Formula Interface","display":"df-pr-graph-interface — Uniform Indexed Graph-Formula Interface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-pr-graph-interface","aliases":["67-df-pr-graph-interface"],"display":"df-pr-graph-interface — Uniform Indexed Graph-Formula Interface","depends_on":["[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]","[[67-df-satisfaction]]","[[67-df-formula]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-pr-graph-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-pr-graph-interface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr-graph-interface — Uniform Indexed Graph-Formula Interface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(D_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(D=(D_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为候选图公式族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k:\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]\">\\(D_k:\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]\\)</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_e(\\vec x,y)\">\\(D_e(\\vec x,y)\\)</span> 时按程序元数取唯一分量并作无捕获代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\gamma:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是代码编译函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 由下式定义。使用本接口时固定满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 的同一个二元组；它是显式前提，不是“原书标准构造”的代称。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对外延 PR 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_f\">\\(\\delta_f\\)</span> 时，必须同时指定程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\">\\(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_f⟧=f\">\\(⟦ e_f⟧=f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_f=D_{e_f}\">\\(\\delta_f=D_{e_f}\\)</span>。从程序进行的有效操作在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f\">\\(e_f\\)</span> 上进行，不假设可以有效判定两个 PR 程序计算同一函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle\\)</span>；所有辅助变量按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的新鲜规则选取。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\)</span> 中未绑定的对象变量均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\\)</span> 绑定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k,m\">\\(\\forall k,m\\)</span> 的程序元数均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\ \\bigl[\nD_k(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]\\land\\gamma(k,e)=g(D_k(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (Q\\vdash\\forall y(D_e(\\bar{\\vec m},y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{⟦ e⟧(\\vec m)}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ D_e(\\vec x,y))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf Z_k}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y(D_{\\mathsf S}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=Sx))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf P_{k,i}}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=x_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\forall\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}D_{e_i}(\\vec x,z_i)\\land D_d(\\vec z,y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,0,y)\\leftrightarrow D_d(\\vec x,y)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,Sn,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,n,z)\\land D_e(\\vec x,n,z,y))\\right)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\delta_{e}&amp;\\coloneqq D_e,\\qquad\n\\delta_f\\coloneqq D_{e_f}\\quad(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land⟦ e_f⟧=f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\ \\bigl[\nD_k(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]\\land\\gamma(k,e)=g(D_k(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (Q\\vdash\\forall y(D_e(\\bar{\\vec m},y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{⟦ e⟧(\\vec m)}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ D_e(\\vec x,y))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf Z_k}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y(D_{\\mathsf S}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=Sx))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf P_{k,i}}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=x_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\forall\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}D_{e_i}(\\vec x,z_i)\\land D_d(\\vec z,y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,0,y)\\leftrightarrow D_d(\\vec x,y)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,Sn,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,n,z)\\land D_e(\\vec x,n,z,y))\\right)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\delta_{e}&amp;\\coloneqq D_e,\\qquad\n\\delta_f\\coloneqq D_{e_f}\\quad(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land⟦ e_f⟧=f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条把统一性、Q 上逐数唯一表示、PA 上全函数性及程序组合/递归方程逐一列明。定义对所声明参数相对；没有把逐函数的任意非一致选择当作一个有效编译器，也没有宣称补入了原书未提供的具体实现或机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle$；所有辅助变量按 [[67-df-formula]] 的新鲜规则选取。下列 $\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash$ 中未绑定的对象变量均由 $\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}$ 绑定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g=c_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"D=(D_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"D_k:\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]","display":false},{"tex":"D_e(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_f","display":false},{"tex":"e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ e_f⟧=f","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_f=D_{e_f}","display":false},{"tex":"e_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\ \\bigl[\nD_k(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,\\ldots,v_k]\\land\\gamma(k,e)=g(D_k(e))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec m\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (Q\\vdash\\forall y(D_e(\\bar{\\vec m},y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{⟦ e⟧(\\vec m)}))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\ D_e(\\vec x,y))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf Z_k}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=0))\\\\\n&\\land(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y(D_{\\mathsf S}(x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=Sx))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\forall i<k\\ (\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf P_{k,i}}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow y=x_i))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k,m\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_m\\forall\\vec e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k^m\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf C_k(d,\\vec e)}(\\vec x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<m}D_{e_i}(\\vec x,z_i)\\land D_d(\\vec z,y)\\right)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\forall e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{k+2}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,0,y)\\leftrightarrow D_d(\\vec x,y)))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}\\left(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,Sn,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists z(D_{\\mathsf R(d,e)}(\\vec x,n,z)\\land D_e(\\vec x,n,z,y))\\right)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\delta_{e}&\\coloneqq D_e,\\qquad\n\\delta_f\\coloneqq D_{e_f}\\quad(e_f\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k\\land⟦ e_f⟧=f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3584,"backlinks":[{"id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的 $D,\\gamma$，满足 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。所有图公式统一记为 $\\delta_e=D_e$，下标 $e\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_k$ 是程序，不以外延函数充当有效索引。"},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对下式引入的每个原始递归函数 $f$，固定实现该检查算法的程序 $e_f$，并以 $\\delta_f=D_{e_f}$ 使用 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 接口。公式中 $\\operatorname{Len}$ 和 $(p)_i$ 是对应图公式的保守定义扩展函数符号；不能改用任意仅在标准模型中正确的表示。"},{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\mathrm{PRProg}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 取 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；固定 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。"},{"id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6367025c1515b676","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"66d369f34bec0254","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g=c_{L_A}$ 取 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]；固定 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。$z,v$ 是各异的算术变量。"},{"id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本条的 $D,\\gamma$ 固定满足 [[67-df-pr-graph-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$；所有层级闭包均以程序图 $\\delta_e$ 为实例，不对外延函数进行未定义的有效选择。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-graph-interface]] — Uniform Indexed Graph-Formula Interface。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-graph-interface]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-pr-graph-interface]]"}],"outgoing":["55353aba49d6b3f2","a329235da6144513","cd051851df5d2aa2","824fdc45d800b7dd","573b4c635ea6d91f","bc53ba723358facc","2035a1f4d72e7df9"]}